      "json_pointer": "/469/1104"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:293fff69c912595c930f187c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『自主训练』，完毕。为了共享“探查结果”，\\n“PORT”——也就是说……『来见我』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6daa64c126e1d9fdbbbeab1ffa37eb9ab09b4b1a33e36e0807e2c199fd5fbdf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1105"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1105"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4bf824cb0372e1493f0afcb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼～自主训练做完啦～。我很了不起对吧？\\n很了不起的吧？请一定要好好来夸奖我哦——。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3c8c6b8f2e2452a481ad911fbf68131e12dba01c517f01803b0ff06cfc06d3c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1106"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1106"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48a8c3a96b1e3a205ef75433",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在自主训练中流了些好汗，心情大好的船长回来啦！\\n那么，能夸奖我让我情绪更高涨的航海士大人在哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1adba6e662e3a4f3644a6e8e02e9c993d541645c4e66992f1ffb7f319d00ccef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1107"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1107"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c021651a721b5f60ebfe05aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了。我想与你共享成果。\\n在等你的这段时间——我就做做肌肉训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "460b7295065dfe33b511e0f2944b2dee48a11de0fac4bba6b68a80e5c68f0d73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1108"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1108"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdf47580f183a38572198c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好——，自主训练结束！……那个！我是不是\\n更接近出色的王冠赛马娘了呢——能请您看看吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "547f2829dae00d13a2da3a121eb6d4ccecd08f257d1140b16d9b59821dc189ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1109"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1109"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11b55e0b61f526c48cfe4561",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练，已全部顺利完成了——\\n呵呵……♪因为想被您夸奖，就不由得努力过头了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3621cd2d94c6136c4ef3dedb235544e664263f40f5fdcd43cbe707014a652f81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1110"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1110"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ed8d6dfc51475fb16d39a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "预定的自主训练已全部完毕。\\n接下来请您确认训练成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06c7f650b6ca9cf653cab75dc5da3e2bf57909c62695b29246b993d56c30da98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
