        "469",
        "1111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbe8bc75235efab6cb580d59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练结束了哦！呐，不马上来见我吗？\\n让我展现给你看看，My queenly radiance♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0fe0fd504beb3cd21ecfb2af25a21e0ab7d8f6aa0c2ff4301eee08e11d1ced",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1112"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1112"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e21ebd741b11ac67376e340",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哇哈～～～～！自主训练，结束啦～！！\\n我超级～努力了……作为奖励，拜托给我平时的两倍哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "187bcc34c0bf1657fff0a3ba90c14a13691cfbce92f948dd9053ab6efa7a4fed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1113"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1113"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:627e5bea259d8af75045ac51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "【画着可爱剪刀手图案的便签】\\n自主训练结束了哦！成果，你要来看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6b5edafec4ec974095a0cb6fc79db597ce0ba44a0afcf48752025693d53bcb2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1114"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1114"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04d15e9b971030664eff1c4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你这家伙，太不敬了。要让本王等到何时。\\n自主训练什么的早就完成了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874a713de1e3caadedb8304d25f1c7657d820fb036b72f30ce65f314bc8e9e91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1115"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1115"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf58a71035892ed9b6422506",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自主训练早就做完啦。来，还不快点\\n过来？让你见识一下变得更加强韧的我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83008808e72c7ac3d2e8803fa5286d12457065a896f530edeb86f644f99b21b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1116"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1116"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9ecc1b4cd979c9028f0401",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然自主训练结束了，但我的实力还远远不足。\\n为了超越“那个家伙”……请您多多指导！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ee30e04629882148eba3834acb89c633eafd4f597f8b2a3d5218d756fdc863b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1117"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1117"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13afeb06cb639d9df579c95b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。自主训练已经结束。\\n请下达接下来的指示。",
      "source_fingerprint": "403daa3c994f2942e206909ee75f3f693de09e55cee16c7044021825cdde0b68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "469",
        "1118"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/469/1118"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73abd313ce808f130688d6ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "差不多，到了您有空的时候了吧？\\n我也刚好……结束了自主训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1be5234a874eef480daa6188c2bac74ab646144f8c5709ec3495ac294e2951b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
